        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shirikarajeanda doabiiwaat bea Yesu Gristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ang'iing'i orjeedeanyu, daruusiida aba jeeda dagheerjeanduumeeda mida jeeda Gristo Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ng'asheega ghayi iyiing'si heedeanyu aba madeeda muushoodiga saang'a iina ng'asheega geatinga fuga doobiiweadi jea ghoamu ghwanal suurja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eepareanyeena sawanadeeda sea aniini, gawuurji shirikarajeanda doabiiwaat bea Gristo Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shirikarajeanda mida jeeda ng'ucheeda maygwadeawiit aba haleanjeeda muunda ng'eanyiida aba gideaba gaygoohoosan shirikarajeandaanyi haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara siida iigaleada aba jeeda deangheeda mwajeataw shiipka iimagaleada muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida barooda Sin gadiyeeda hang'waay gammiisa gideaba gayghwanyas haghweega madeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ateemsheesiina muuchi ng'asheesu sean earguun, aba gideaba gaygagoonyi Ng'utamiida fughareeda aba badayda ng'asheega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apkaada Yesu Gristo, dea ghayi duuna miyeeda, bea dooshta Dawdi, gawuurji gidanyaashta Giijasteanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini geesawanan aba badaydeaba Giijasi miyiin, ea eeyaadan ghealooniga dawuurji siida Sin ng'asheega munyas, ak ng'asheega ASEETA ea mwajearat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba sareani geamilikteaysi ng'asheega sean aba badayda fuga loat ASEETA, gideaba eara saawa ghwanyas lealeanooda mida jeeda Gristo Yesu ea giigheambiita ea eaweega manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheanji gammiisa masaweega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siida gadiyeeda mwas ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apkeasiina fugaagu ng'asheesu nea gireekusi aba madeeda ASEETA gideaba ghoabuut ng'asheega ng'alealeeda mwaloada gil nung' gwarooda fuga aleeysiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Milmiliida eadaanyi gideaba nimwasnyi ASEETA, siida gadiyeeda mabwaspwasa aba gadiyeadaanyi, ak giinaali ng'asheanda huumwa aba gidamiisiinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'aamwana geaw ng'asheega mwaloada gil, mawoosa gea diiniin giika mamwasa fuga ASEETEAN, aba gideaba fuga sunu gayghoabita jeeda ng'asheega munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ng'asheanda nyaawa gaygageawiit iita ea gawuurji udamusuura. Aba jeedeaba suuk gwanda geaba Himenayo ea Fileto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea saawa ea ninung'waada naweedida bea huumeandean nea geebaloola gideaba duunooda goola ghwahidu, ea ghwayam masaweega buuneeda mwaatkwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak sindeeta ghayi iin ASEETA ea nimiinaada nea majeek, nea uhuudaanyi geengoorsa ng'asheesu, “Ng'utamiida ghwanal gea was gaaschi.” Ak gicha “Gilinyoo gwaruku gheawunga Ng'utamiida ea danung'waada ng'asheega munyas.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda gheeda haw manda dabita gharinga meeng'meeng'i ea dabita gharinga ak ea mabeachi suh, gwanda eara gea geediga ea gea sigeeda suuk gwanda gea mureeda suuk ea mandeawana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak siida iyaamiidu geaw ak gooheeli geaw ng'asheesu munyasiin niny abeeda gayghoah dabicheanda siihuun ak ghwanyas mureeda haguuwsa Ng'utamiida ak sinoadaanyi geebaysiina gwasin gadiyoojiga sean miyaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi mang'wana ng'asheega munyas bea gheareemaneanduumeeda was geawunda gheang'da, aada geeshta ng'asheega doabiiw ea masaweega ea bariinyeega ea hoyyoo sea fuga sean guuriisa Ng'utamiida aba jeeda miy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi heawana sheang'nyeeda leendeeda manda jeeda fughareeda, ak ginali gideaba sheang'nyeeni gaygwaji jaliida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea mamiisiina siida gadiyeeda Ng'utamiida gaba jaliida, gammiisa gideaba gajea garbabu aba heeda buuneesean, biissa nala goonealshi ak gamilikiida ng'asheega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damandida reekusiina fuga mamwasa ng'asheagaaschiin, gammiisa ea garbabu aba gideaba iideepa gwasa gwadeepa ghoadaw ASEETA fiisu duukuunooda ak ghwanal huumeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gabiiksa fughareenga nyaawa, ak gwariteawa jeeda gadageeda Shataani ghayi ang'waay saawa ak gwasin gidagasiida Shataani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
